## 4. The "Elevator Pitch" (Visual Description)
*If you need to describe it without showing it:*
"Imagine if an EMR system was redesigned by a Zen Master. No clutter. Just a clean scroll, and three AI spirits—The Hunter, The Shield, and The Calculator—sitting on your screen, waiting for your command."
